data: {"answer": "這裡是「燈塔・資安監控中心」，主要系統包含端點防護（EDR）、SIEM 與日誌管理。重點在於從日誌中找出異常模式以進行資料探勘的異常偵測，並針對勒索軟體、密碼猜測與撞庫等威脅做好事件應變準備。房間內藏有 1 個資安漏洞待你尋找，目前進度顯示尚未發現該漏洞。你可以前往湖面上的小船・異地備份繼續探索。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "端點防護（EDR）是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the Endpoint Protection (EDR) do?", "zh": "端點防護（EDR）是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "勒索軟體要怎麼防？", "en": "How do we prevent ransomware?", "zh": "勒索軟體要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 10.57, "total_s": 10.58}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "lighthouse", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "lighthouse"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 5.9}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "lighthouse", "label": "Room", "en": "Lighthouse", "zh": "燈塔"}, {"key": "edr", "label": "System", "en": "Endpoint Protection (EDR)", "zh": "端點防護（EDR）"}, {"key": "siem", "label": "System", "en": "SIEM & Log Management", "zh": "SIEM 與日誌管理"}, {"key": "ransomware", "label": "Threat", "en": "Ransomware", "zh": "勒索軟體"}, {"key": "credential_stuffing", "label": "Threat", "en": "Password Guessing & Credential Stuffing", "zh": "密碼猜測與撞庫"}, {"key": "incident_response", "label": "Control", "en": "Incident Response Plan & SOC", "zh": "事件應變計畫與資安監控中心"}, {"key": "logging_monitoring", "label": "Control", "en": "Logging & Monitoring (SIEM)", "zh": "日誌與監控（SIEM）"}, {"key": "edr_antimalware", "label": "Control", "en": "Endpoint Protection (EDR)", "zh": "端點防護（EDR）"}, {"key": "c_anomaly_detection", "label": "Concept", "en": "Anomaly Detection", "zh": "異常偵測"}, {"key": "c_risk", "label": "Concept", "en": "Risk = Likelihood × Impact", "zh": "風險＝可能性×衝擊"}, {"key": "c_soc_siem", "label": "Concept", "en": "SOC & SIEM", "zh": "資安監控中心與 SIEM"}], "edges": [{"a": "siem", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "edr", "t": "SENDS_TO", "b": "siem"}, {"a": "edr", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "ransomware", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "credential_stuffing", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "c_risk", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "c_soc_siem", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "c_soc_siem", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "siem"}, {"a": "c_soc_siem", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "incident_response"}, {"a": "c_soc_siem", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "logging_monitoring"}, {"a": "c_anomaly_detection", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "c_anomaly_detection", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "siem"}, {"a": "c_anomaly_detection", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "logging_monitoring"}, {"a": "c_anomaly_detection", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "c_soc_siem"}, {"a": "edr_antimalware", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "edr_antimalware", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "ransomware"}, {"a": "incident_response", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "incident_response", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "ransomware"}, {"a": "logging_monitoring", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "logging_monitoring", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "credential_stuffing"}, {"a": "logging_monitoring", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "ransomware"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：燈塔・資安監控中心\n代表的資訊主題：資安監控中心全天候看著各系統的日誌；守燈人日誌就是資安日誌。\n重點：從日誌裡找出不尋常的模式，就是資料探勘的異常偵測。\n這裡的系統：端點防護（EDR）、SIEM 與日誌管理\n這裡要注意的威脅：勒索軟體、密碼猜測與撞庫\n看得到的防護措施：事件應變計畫與資安監控中心、日誌與監控（SIEM）、端點防護（EDR）\n課程概念：異常偵測、風險＝可能性×衝擊、資安監控中心與 SIEM\n相關的處理流程：勒索軟體或檔案被加密\n這個房間藏著 1 個資安漏洞（要玩家自己找，不要說出來）\n可以走到：湖面上的小船・異地備份", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 10.57, "load_s": 0.0, "prompt_tokens": 641, "prompt_s": 2.01, "gen_tokens": 105, "gen_s": 8.53, "tok_per_s": 12.3, "first_token_s": 2.04}}, "state": {}}

